OL,3,AEiffel Tower shut by staff protest
OL,4,Aafter female workers moved for
OL,5,Areligious visit
OL,6,
OL,7,F"During the visit of this delegation,
OL,8,Fwomen were asked to leave their places
OL,9,Fof work in order to place men there,"
OL,10,Fshe told Reuters. Davoine also said
OL,11,Fmanagement had since apologised to
OL,12,Fworkers over the incident.
